Revision history for Claude-Agent-Code-Refactor

0.03    2026-10-17
	- Require Claude::Agent 0.14 and Claude::Agent::Code::Review 0.03; close the query when a fix ends or times out.
	- Add the effort option, passed to both the review and the fix.

0.02    2026-01-11
        - Call Query->cleanup() after iteration to release SDK server sockets
        - Fixes socket accumulation in refactor_until_clean loops
        - Requires Claude::Agent 0.09+

0.01    2026-01-10
        First version, released on an unsuspecting world.

